#: badend5:badend5_BBEF13A2_BB0F_4A79_B501_E9A68ED3ECA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59545849c64164c94efb3344c1fd729d853d5e5265f40e69980ed61c72a47d5b
#. default-sha256: df137deec28184cc6f02325fdbe3c5fe9ed5547379405a97a9faedc06606e4e7
msgctxt "badend5:badend5_BBEF13A2_BB0F_4A79_B501_E9A68ED3ECA9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫"
"You’ve made the right decision, Michel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫そ"
"う……、⟪k:17⟫それで良いのですよ、⟪k:18⟫ミシェル。"

#: badend5:badend5_83564003_4394_490F_B68B_0F69DF183169
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e414d7081b21ee56dc953b0a7b64fed8d52fe4f688b1b68da30b34426814341
#. default-sha256: 91a3297b55dadae598ecf525a3f42df7981ba056587aa5f36cc3fd08abb2abbd
msgctxt "badend5:badend5_83564003_4394_490F_B68B_0F69DF183169"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Your tragic tale has finally come to an end."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫これで――あなたの辛い物語も終わりを迎えるのです。"

#: badend5:badend5_B76F5D6E_10F3_4739_9D24_003030A012AB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2bc2398d52694918013e253bbab1226128ebcd23b5065f699e79f9027a3aa077
#. default-sha256: 12a62c2ed03cc4a27894770b601c32927e6246e95acc1ff1d08724415e1f0d08
msgctxt "badend5:badend5_B76F5D6E_10F3_4739_9D24_003030A012AB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You’re free from the grip of this cursed mansion—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫free to begin your life anew."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そして、⟪k:1⟫この呪われた館から解放され――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫新たな人生を歩みだすことが出来るのです……。"

#: badend5:badend5_B5231881_9804_4A29_9A8D_C27497A519D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3ce2984091a6682d7af5c2cdc14e28b07ace81bb139218115a6666665ca53a0
#. default-sha256: 5d36da3e253f119c8750468241dd7714d8524ad79e4e37403c65d2d8a08b8673
msgctxt "badend5:badend5_B5231881_9804_4A29_9A8D_C27497A519D2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wish you a wonderful life,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それはきっと――さぞ光に満ちた、⟪k:1⟫素晴らしいものでしょう。"

#: badend5:badend5_D76E6452_7102_4582_A162_5866DDAB8A55
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad306a665fd5eae1aa95ed24006c0937da2182eb9149130731982b5c7f276d36
#. default-sha256: e06faab51f4e7647ba0daf578a71345525e4b15ef3f864b197c2673bcabd84be
msgctxt "badend5:badend5_D76E6452_7102_4582_A162_5866DDAB8A55"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫richly fulfilling and abounding in light."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私が……あなたの良き人生を、⟪k:1⟫願ってさしあげましょう。"

#: badend5:badend5_60370D30_8D56_42CF_B457_4881616FC1D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b42a7b55431ab0428a71f81b14169f56f11c920476e032ac973c46579de2feb6
#. default-sha256: dfd130d9b3c6d90a6403f32ecc8f4517aad602fae09cb3e1141652df856935e7
msgctxt "badend5:badend5_60370D30_8D56_42CF_B457_4881616FC1D7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For you, my dear friend, I will not cast a curse,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but give you my utmost blessing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私の愛しき友人であったあなたのために――呪いではなく。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫祝福の願いを……かけてさしあげま"
"す。"

#: badend5:badend5_7BEEFB39_D103_4CE7_A33F_220A478E40E8
