#: badend5:badend5_5D7A5D26_0D02_4F27_98DD_7C5277A389E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06e6ef1db7aa7d190da0f42b66a819b40c233f081e14f12dd7432605582db728
