#: badend5:badend5_F770B190_B8F6_499E_8CEC_B78F26A93231
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 265cc87e17021f0beddf80d00733b3d14828192a4fdb89058e2147fcfea5cbaa
