msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……ええと……、⟪k:1⟫何の話を……していましたっけ。"

#: badend5:badend5_22A3A367_B50D_46BE_8D2A_00044CB8B667
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b67f1422ccd233a750669d47bb41a7b1f1c8b836bcb479262832c5121112e44
#. default-sha256: 7d2e406a9e8276538e0e529d312cdf2af16358349634348c7b159f3fff040ad3
msgctxt "badend5:badend5_22A3A367_B50D_46BE_8D2A_00044CB8B667"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Are you sure you’re okay?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I was saying we need to settle on a destination for our "
"trip next month."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……本当に大丈夫ですか……？⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ほら、⟪k:3⟫来月の旅行の……、⟪k:4⟫どこに行くか決めようって話"
"です。"

#: badend5:badend5_86396821_A704_466D_BDC8_B9DA192F8AC1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14af1fac98629e5a13bf204f49ddc1109b0f514e672b8550a93d8ae6d8f65553
#. default-sha256: 067d39561e8c139cedcffccb250cd6e145997f91e65cebddcad6a88750b4c9dd
msgctxt "badend5:badend5_86396821_A704_466D_BDC8_B9DA192F8AC1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ahh... ⟪k:1⟫Anywhere you’d like is fine with me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……ああ……、⟪k:1⟫貴女の……好きな場所で大丈夫ですよ。"

#: badend5:badend5_7B84C3A8_4D0F_4F9F_BAC2_E5C67DB83917
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a645712cf9c0004e6f47f3fb95c566e1f2b4a6256e01cc1f0fe41250f5a52d9
#. default-sha256: f0ab151b2745be4318c1103e1bf3ffa1f2bd512df2274fa99d9a45d5745384cd
msgctxt "badend5:badend5_7B84C3A8_4D0F_4F9F_BAC2_E5C67DB83917"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫that’s always how it goes with you, isn’t it?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You are allowed to have "
"an opinion of your own, you know."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ふふ……、⟪k:1⟫いつもそういう風に言うんですから。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫たまには、⟪k:4⟫あなたの好きな場所に"
"してくださいね？"

#: badend5:badend5_8FAE56BF_1795_4ACC_B488_406EB3C79BEC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f77f766fa1cb0d9624d5b8a82205daf7eec1fefde161a6ebcc0ecf09b6eac90
#. default-sha256: 463b6a8afc74e0ac9c03b75056f0186d8bbdab6598aa1b1851d52271772fedc6
msgctxt "badend5:badend5_8FAE56BF_1795_4ACC_B488_406EB3C79BEC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We’ll end up going to Prague again if you let me pick."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私が決めると、⟪k:1⟫またプラハになっちゃいますよ……？"

#: badend5:badend5_4F9A34C5_FB50_441D_A1C9_B99B9E40C585
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 979c2eccc82fca7c8141dfdcc439133a6df32f1a327dd80af393062eeccbb899
#. default-sha256: 7ca1c54b3a96f0debe95d46d73c8f9018ddf7c6ab5cdfcda904cd8cfde7a1291
msgctxt "badend5:badend5_4F9A34C5_FB50_441D_A1C9_B99B9E40C585"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There’s nothing wrong with Prague.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We can go see Mucha’s stained-glass window at "
"the St. Vitus Cathedral and visit the Petřín Gardens again."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫良いと思いますよ、⟪k:1⟫プラハ……。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫またミュシャのステンドグラスを見て、⟪k:4⟫ペトジー"
"ン公園に行って。"

#: badend5:badend5_DDC5A25E_7AAF_4FF8_957F_F3CCFF4C6A23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fae82009cebea9019ea39e25a577433f3afc50d073ceb933689132e64786954f
