msgctxt "badend5:badend5_DDC5A25E_7AAF_4FF8_957F_F3CCFF4C6A23"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And maybe this time, we won’t be late for the Walk of the Apostles at the clock tower."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫今度は時計台の十二使徒に、⟪k:1⟫間に合うようにしましょうか。"

#: badend5:badend5_235E0583_6691_45E7_BA54_F8BFDE73790C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3feeed06537749733ad5b8651ef904481a7df6498f88d0d4b7df2345bc8d19f
